WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.928 --> 00:00:13.013
I'm Dr. Fielder

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.140
My goal is to heal your mind

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:18.018
and reintegrate you into society
as soon as possible

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:19.561
I'm not insane

00:00:19.644 --> 00:00:20.478
Stay calm

00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:20.729
Wait no 

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:21.521
No

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:22.689
No

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:23.273
Don’t move

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:24.649
You’re making a mistake

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:27.569
After 18 months

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:28.570
Today's the big day

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.196
 18 months?

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:31.906
Are you okay, Stephen?

00:00:31.906 --> 00:00:33.825
I saved you from years in prison

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:34.242
Baby

00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:37.912
You really don't remember a thing do you Stephen?

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:38.246
No

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:39.664
Nothing

00:00:39.664 --> 00:00:41.458
Doctor said one every morning

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:42.375
I'm fine

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.586
Something's not right

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:46.463
Father

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:48.214
Please go now

00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:51.301
I just got this awful feeling

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.680
It's all coming back 

00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:57.807
I'm not the person that I thought I was

00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:00.852
I want to know exactly what's going on

00:01:00.852 --> 00:01:02.979
You're mistaking dreams for memories

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:04.898
These aren't dreams

00:01:07.275 --> 00:01:08.193
You’re not making any sense

00:01:10.111 --> 00:01:11.237
I feel like I'm caught

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.364
I’m here

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:14.574
But I'm not here

00:01:16.993 --> 00:01:18.536
It's a sick experiment

00:01:18.995 --> 00:01:20.371
The doctor said this might happen

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.501
I'm not going to hurt you, Stephen

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:26.669
Maybe it's time to call the doctor

00:01:26.669 --> 00:01:27.921
How long we've been friends?

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:29.756
How long we've been friends?

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.925
I honestly can't even remember

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:32.884
Well, that's right

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.012
I’m innocent

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:38.014
My mind was never yours

00:01:38.014 --> 00:01:40.266
You remember what we want you to remember

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:45.939
I know what they’re doing here

00:01:46.231 --> 00:01:46.856
Wake up

00:01:53.238 --> 00:01:54.447
Close your eyes and relax

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:55.156
We'll get started

